2016-02-09T09:05:26.515-0600 | ERROR | qtp1245173695-70 | NamePasswordCallbackHandler | 74 - org.apache.cxf.cxf-core - 3.0.4 | ... | Unsupported callback type org.apache.karaf.jaas.modules.publickey.PublickeyCallback 
